  "details": "Using the center of the proximity contacts radius to calculate distance expects the object with the proximity sensor to be round in nature. Having the ability to offset the measured point (the point it changes to 1), using the root transform object for example, would allow for much greater control for avatar creators.\n\nI believe it would also allow for single axis proximity contacts like this canny requests:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/open-beta/p/request-proximity-along-single-local-axis-with-custom-distance-point\n\nnakos",
